msgid "[Anonympins bot mitigation security warning]"
msgstr "[Anonympins bot mitigation security warning]"

msgid "Your website is currently running on unencrypted HTTP. In this mode, modern web browsers disable the native Web Cryptography API (crypto.subtle) for security reasons, forcing a JavaScript fallback simulation that is slower and vulnerable to Man-in-the-Middle (MitM) attacks. We strongly recommend deploying a TLS/SSL certificate and enforcing HTTPS to ensure the cryptographic integrity of Proof-of-Work computations and identity protection."
msgstr "Your website is currently running on unencrypted HTTP. In this mode, modern web browsers disable the native Web Cryptography API (crypto.subtle) for security reasons, forcing a JavaScript fallback simulation that is slower and vulnerable to Man-in-the-Middle (MitM) attacks. We strongly recommend deploying a TLS/SSL certificate and enforcing HTTPS to ensure the cryptographic integrity of Proof-of-Work computations and identity protection."

